WEBVTT

00:00:08.370 --> 00:00:11.290
We'll be moving in half a year due to my dad's job.

00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:14.410
It'll be for a short while, but I look forward to it.

00:00:16.830 --> 00:00:21.620
Half a year... Am I ultimately just wasting time?

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:23.580
Congrats, Tsutsui!

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:26.540
This is great! This is really great!

00:00:26.540 --> 00:00:28.540
Huh? Uh, yeah...

00:00:28.910 --> 00:00:30.000
Tsutsun.

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:36.620
Let's go home together.

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:44.450
Bring on the everlasting explosions!

00:02:16.040 --> 00:02:20.290
EPISODE 2

00:02:16.040 --> 00:02:20.290
ABOUT THE TIME MY CHASTITY

00:02:16.040 --> 00:02:20.290
WAS IN A PERDICAMENT.

00:02:18.910 --> 00:02:21.540
Huh? Is Igarashi seriously dating Tsutsui?

00:02:21.620 --> 00:02:24.330
N-no way, she's with that gloomy guy?

00:02:24.870 --> 00:02:27.500
Don't talk badly about my boyfriend.

00:02:32.120 --> 00:02:34.040
Wh-what are you doing?!

00:02:34.040 --> 00:02:37.080
What? Did I say something weird?

00:02:37.330 --> 00:02:39.540
I'm a gloomy guy! That's okay!

00:02:39.540 --> 00:02:42.250
I just hate it when attention is drawn to me!

00:02:42.330 --> 00:02:46.500
But they say whatever they want

00:02:42.330 --> 00:02:46.500
even though they don't know anything about you...

00:02:46.830 --> 00:02:47.950
I hate that.

00:02:52.080 --> 00:02:55.910
But that's okay. It's always been that way.

00:02:56.410 --> 00:02:57.330
But...

00:02:58.000 --> 00:03:01.160
I wonder if that's her way of really dating someone.

00:03:07.540 --> 00:03:08.830
Hey, Tsutsun.

00:03:09.620 --> 00:03:11.200
What are you doing on Sunday?

00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:12.620
Uh, Sunday?

00:03:12.870 --> 00:03:15.250
It's a release date for a game

00:03:12.870 --> 00:03:15.250
so I'll be at the electronics store.

00:03:15.250 --> 00:03:16.330
Oh?

00:03:16.330 --> 00:03:18.830
Then you'll be gaming the whole day after that?

00:03:18.950 --> 00:03:19.870
That's right.

00:03:20.910 --> 00:03:22.200
That's boring.

00:03:23.580 --> 00:03:24.410
Huh?

00:03:31.250 --> 00:03:33.950
I've been in line since morning, but I've finally got it...

00:03:50.700 --> 00:03:52.330
What are you doing on Sunday?

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:55.950
Was I perhaps... being invited?

00:03:56.370 --> 00:03:57.660
That's boring.

00:03:58.080 --> 00:04:01.750
And when she's bored... is this what happens?

00:04:02.080 --> 00:04:03.790
Game over.

00:04:06.120 --> 00:04:09.040
Dammit. I knew it...

00:04:28.200 --> 00:04:29.660
You're gonna break the window!

00:04:31.910 --> 00:04:33.700
I missed you so I came here.

00:04:38.290 --> 00:04:40.330
But we can see each other at school tomorrow.

00:04:40.830 --> 00:04:44.040
We can't call it dating if we only meet at school.

00:04:45.080 --> 00:04:46.290
Is that so...

00:04:48.790 --> 00:04:52.370
Okay then, what's your definition of "dating"?

00:04:53.500 --> 00:05:00.870
I thought I didn't care if you were serious or not,

00:04:53.500 --> 00:05:00.870
but this really might be impossible after all.

00:05:02.700 --> 00:05:08.120
I don't have the patience of those other guys,

00:05:02.700 --> 00:05:08.120
so hanging out while dating...

00:05:08.330 --> 00:05:10.330
I don't understand the conditions of that.

00:05:17.250 --> 00:05:19.250
Tsutsun, come with me.

00:05:28.120 --> 00:05:29.580
What are you intending to do?!

00:05:29.830 --> 00:05:33.790
It's alright if you can understand

00:05:29.830 --> 00:05:33.790
that you and I are seriously dating, right?

00:05:33.790 --> 00:05:35.620
Huh? Uh...

00:05:46.160 --> 00:05:48.450
This is my first time.

00:05:50.950 --> 00:05:52.120
No way!

00:05:52.500 --> 00:05:53.370
What is this?!

00:05:53.370 --> 00:05:56.830
Suddenly it's just the two of us in a locked room

00:05:53.370 --> 00:05:56.830
as if this is some manga or anime or something!

00:05:56.830 --> 00:05:58.660
No, no, no, no, nope, nope, nope, nope, nope!

00:05:59.200 --> 00:06:00.870
If we do it, you'll understand.

00:06:03.250 --> 00:06:04.200
Wait a second!

00:06:23.160 --> 00:06:24.620
This type of thing...

00:06:24.620 --> 00:06:28.000
Isn't it something we do when

00:06:24.620 --> 00:06:28.000
we get to know each other better?

00:06:28.290 --> 00:06:33.250
By the way, if this is really your first time,

00:06:28.290 --> 00:06:33.250
you have to value yourself more.

00:06:33.660 --> 00:06:36.950
What do you mean? Is that how it is in manga and stuff?

00:06:37.160 --> 00:06:39.160
There is a genre like this, I think!

00:06:39.540 --> 00:06:41.160
But this is real life.

00:06:41.330 --> 00:06:43.620
THOUGHTS                                                                          REALITY

00:06:49.700 --> 00:06:52.080
Wait a minute, I'm gonna go google it.

00:06:52.370 --> 00:06:53.370
Google what?

00:06:53.790 --> 00:06:55.870
This is my first time, you know...

00:06:56.450 --> 00:06:59.290
It doesn't seem like now is very different than I thought.

00:07:01.120 --> 00:07:03.120
Don't make light of the chastity of an otaku,

00:07:03.120 --> 00:07:05.160
they have their own dreams and ideals.

00:07:05.450 --> 00:07:09.330
If we do something like this now,

00:07:05.450 --> 00:07:09.330
neither of us will understand anything.

00:07:12.040 --> 00:07:13.370
Tsutsun!

00:07:17.250 --> 00:07:21.080
I just... wanted to talk properly.

00:07:22.250 --> 00:07:24.000
That's all I wanted...

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:28.160
PHARMACIST'S OFFICE

00:07:28.160 --> 00:07:29.700
PRESCRIPTION

00:07:28.160 --> 00:07:29.700
DROP OFF

00:07:28.330 --> 00:07:29.700
Take care!

00:07:29.830 --> 00:07:31.450
Internal Medication

00:07:29.830 --> 00:07:31.450
Tsutsui Mitsuru

00:07:29.830 --> 00:07:31.450
2 week supply

00:07:29.830 --> 00:07:31.450
1 x a day after breakfast

00:07:29.830 --> 00:07:31.450
Coniel 4mg

00:07:29.830 --> 00:07:31.450
Micardis 40mg

00:07:39.000 --> 00:07:43.080
I don't understand anything about her...

00:07:44.660 --> 00:07:46.620
Hello, Doctor.

00:07:47.410 --> 00:07:49.910
Hello. How are you feeling?

00:07:50.330 --> 00:07:51.660
That person...

00:07:50.330 --> 00:07:51.660
Doing well, thanks to you.

00:07:51.660 --> 00:07:52.120
Doing well, thanks to you.

00:07:52.450 --> 00:07:55.500
I'm glad to hear that. Well then, take care.

00:07:54.080 --> 00:08:00.580
PERSCRIPTION DROP OFF

00:07:59.580 --> 00:08:01.370
Hey... please wait!

00:08:01.790 --> 00:08:02.620
Yes?

00:08:02.750 --> 00:08:04.370
U-uh, I-

00:08:05.200 --> 00:08:07.870
Iroha Igarashi! Do you know her?

00:08:13.580 --> 00:08:16.580
Of what relation is Igarashi to you?

00:08:17.620 --> 00:08:20.660
Her boyfriend... probably.

00:08:21.370 --> 00:08:22.620
I don't know.

00:08:24.250 --> 00:08:28.410
On Sunday, I saw you and her walking together.

00:08:28.700 --> 00:08:29.580
Oh?

00:08:30.080 --> 00:08:33.450
Oh crap... If this guy is her preferred boyfriend,

00:08:33.450 --> 00:08:38.080
then that clearly makes me a creepy

00:08:33.450 --> 00:08:38.080
self-professed boyfriend stalker!

00:08:40.200 --> 00:08:41.410
I see...

00:08:41.950 --> 00:08:44.450
You mean you want to know

00:08:41.950 --> 00:08:44.450
the relationship between us.

00:08:46.500 --> 00:08:48.120
We are not dating.

00:08:48.290 --> 00:08:50.500
Th-then, are you just messing around with her?!

00:08:50.500 --> 00:08:52.830
Uh, no, that isn't it...

00:08:53.160 --> 00:08:55.370
Oh, but, I don't think it's something I can bluntly s-

00:08:55.370 --> 00:08:58.370
It's an indefinable relationship?! Is that what it is?!

00:08:59.160 --> 00:09:00.910
You sure are annoying.

00:09:01.290 --> 00:09:04.830
I-I saw her here! She was by herself, crying!

00:09:06.950 --> 00:09:08.700
Please treat her properly.

00:09:08.700 --> 00:09:11.750
"Properly?" Aren't you her boyfriend?

00:09:12.080 --> 00:09:14.540
Why aren't you saying "please break it off"?

00:09:14.540 --> 00:09:17.250
Because it looks like she'd definitely

00:09:14.540 --> 00:09:17.250
be happier going out with you!

00:09:18.830 --> 00:09:20.330
You can tell by looking at me, right?

00:09:20.620 --> 00:09:23.500
There's no way I have the skill to fight you.

00:09:25.370 --> 00:09:28.330
You're useless, aren't you? Weak...

00:09:29.540 --> 00:09:32.250
She doesn't need someone like that on her side.

00:09:36.620 --> 00:09:38.580
I'm telling you, I know that!

00:09:38.580 --> 00:09:41.790
I hope all good-looking normie doctors explode!

00:09:44.950 --> 00:09:46.830
I wonder what you have to say.

00:09:49.120 --> 00:09:53.700
What kind of story does someone tell,

00:09:49.120 --> 00:09:53.700
who goes home and leaves a girl all alone?

00:09:53.700 --> 00:09:55.830
I'll properly apologize for that later!

00:09:56.660 --> 00:09:57.450
More importantly...

00:09:57.750 --> 00:09:59.500
Break up with that doctor!

00:10:01.500 --> 00:10:03.870
What do you know, Tsutsun?

00:10:04.830 --> 00:10:07.790
I saw you and that doctor walking around town...

00:10:08.540 --> 00:10:12.080
And also, I happened to run into him

00:10:08.540 --> 00:10:12.080
at the hospital yesterday.

00:10:13.330 --> 00:10:15.700
You've been messing around with him!

00:10:19.200 --> 00:10:20.370
I see.

00:10:21.500 --> 00:10:24.080
You got curious about that, huh, Tsutsun?

00:10:26.250 --> 00:10:29.000
That's right. That person is my boyfriend.

00:10:30.290 --> 00:10:32.040
I also lied about being a virgin...

00:10:32.330 --> 00:10:35.700
I'm sorry. People like you are just so interesting...

00:10:40.790 --> 00:10:42.910
Which is also a lie.

00:10:44.500 --> 00:10:46.830
That person is my family doctor.

00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:51.660
I... have a serious illness.

00:10:56.000 --> 00:10:58.500
This is completely beyond my capacity...

00:10:59.000 --> 00:11:01.250
What do I do about that?

00:11:02.040 --> 00:11:03.660
I have a serious illness.

00:11:04.500 --> 00:11:07.700
I am no match for this...

00:11:08.290 --> 00:11:09.830
I hate you, Ezomichi!

00:11:10.160 --> 00:11:13.950
You're always so selfish, you don't understand

00:11:10.160 --> 00:11:13.950
the common sense of the human world,

00:11:13.950 --> 00:11:15.910
and I'm tired of being together with you!

00:11:15.910 --> 00:11:21.500
And I've been burdened

00:11:15.910 --> 00:11:21.500
with this magical mission... I'm tired of it!

00:11:21.660 --> 00:11:25.950
But, Irori, I thought only you would be

00:11:21.660 --> 00:11:25.950
the only one always on my side!

00:11:30.450 --> 00:11:31.450
Iroha!

00:11:31.950 --> 00:11:32.700
Tsutsun?

00:11:33.160 --> 00:11:35.040
I'll always be on your side!

00:11:35.160 --> 00:11:36.870
I don't know what illness it is, but...

00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:39.000
I will protect you and always watch over you!

00:11:39.500 --> 00:11:40.910
I should explain.

00:11:41.080 --> 00:11:43.700
Last night, after Tsutsui watched our movie,

00:11:43.870 --> 00:11:47.830
in order to rouse himself up,

00:11:43.870 --> 00:11:47.830
he stayed up all night playing a hero game.

00:11:47.830 --> 00:11:51.500
Because of that, his condition is an ultimate hero high!

00:11:48.000 --> 00:11:51.620
TSUTSUI STATUS

00:11:48.000 --> 00:11:51.620
"HERO HIGH"

00:11:52.750 --> 00:11:55.330
Tsutsun... aren't you being a kinda narcissistic right now?

00:11:55.330 --> 00:11:56.200
Huh?

00:11:56.580 --> 00:11:58.910
What I said yesterday was all a lie.

00:11:58.910 --> 00:11:59.620
A lie?!

00:11:59.950 --> 00:12:02.790
I go to the hospital, but it's just for asthma.

00:12:02.790 --> 00:12:03.950
You...!

00:12:04.750 --> 00:12:05.870
Sorry.

00:12:06.200 --> 00:12:09.200
You were thinking a lot about me in your own way, huh?

00:12:11.200 --> 00:12:12.290
Thank you.

00:12:12.660 --> 00:12:13.620
Yeah.

00:12:15.950 --> 00:12:17.500
What are you here for today?

00:12:17.500 --> 00:12:19.830
I can't cure any love sickness, though.

00:12:19.830 --> 00:12:20.540
I'm so sorry!

00:12:20.750 --> 00:12:26.160
The thought that you're her asthma doctor,

00:12:20.750 --> 00:12:26.160
I was so embarrassed I thought I'd bleed with shame!

00:12:26.160 --> 00:12:27.080
You mean "burn".

00:12:27.370 --> 00:12:29.160
So you talked with her about things?

00:12:29.250 --> 00:12:30.080
Yes!

00:12:31.160 --> 00:12:34.700
Speaking of Igarashi,

00:12:31.160 --> 00:12:34.700
did you know that her birthday is next week?

00:12:34.950 --> 00:12:35.750
Huh?!

00:12:36.120 --> 00:12:39.120
I only realized it when I was updating

00:12:36.120 --> 00:12:39.120
her medical records yesterday.

00:12:40.200 --> 00:12:42.620
You seem poorly informed so I'm telling you that.

00:12:42.910 --> 00:12:45.080
I'll pretend I didn't hear what you just said.

00:12:45.250 --> 00:12:46.370
What, why?!

00:12:46.540 --> 00:12:48.830
Well, I don't know anything at all.

00:12:49.000 --> 00:12:50.870
I don't know what to do for her birthday.

00:12:51.080 --> 00:12:52.250
Hey, you.

00:12:52.450 --> 00:12:55.660
Don't you think a birthday

00:12:52.450 --> 00:12:55.660
that isn't celebrated by your lover is sad?!

00:12:55.830 --> 00:12:58.120
I..I don't know.

00:12:58.410 --> 00:13:01.450
I've only ever celebrated them in internet games.

00:13:03.450 --> 00:13:06.580
If that's the truth, then you don't know anything about her.

00:13:07.950 --> 00:13:10.620
U-um, what does she like?

00:13:10.620 --> 00:13:11.620
I don't know!

00:13:11.950 --> 00:13:13.540
Huh? Uh...

00:13:13.950 --> 00:13:15.950
I'm busy so that's it for now.

00:13:16.290 --> 00:13:19.700
Wh..what do I do?!

00:13:22.950 --> 00:13:25.120
Hey, do you like sweets?

00:13:25.370 --> 00:13:27.870
If it's chocolate, it's okay.

00:13:27.870 --> 00:13:29.620
I don't like cream and stuff.

00:13:30.290 --> 00:13:31.830
So cake is no good either.

00:13:32.330 --> 00:13:33.250
Hey...

00:13:33.830 --> 00:13:35.830
I'd like to come to your house.

00:13:35.830 --> 00:13:36.660
Huh?!

00:13:38.540 --> 00:13:39.410
I'm home...

00:13:42.200 --> 00:13:44.620
H-Hikari's brought a girl?!

00:13:45.040 --> 00:13:46.330
Nice to meet you.

00:13:46.500 --> 00:13:48.160
Wh-who the heck are you?!

00:13:48.540 --> 00:13:52.700
Tsutsui-kun and I are dating. I'm Iroha Igarashi.

00:13:52.910 --> 00:13:56.080
You're... da... ting?!

00:13:56.500 --> 00:13:57.700
Let's go upstairs.

00:13:58.000 --> 00:13:59.660
Please pardon me!

00:14:00.040 --> 00:14:01.950
Mom, I can't believe this!

00:14:02.120 --> 00:14:06.160
Please... Please treat Hikari well!

00:14:07.290 --> 00:14:09.580
Amazing!

00:14:09.580 --> 00:14:11.910
I've seen ones like these on TV!

00:14:12.160 --> 00:14:13.620
Just sit wherever.

00:14:15.500 --> 00:14:16.290
What?

00:14:16.700 --> 00:14:23.450
Oh, I was thinking this is nice. This side of you where you

00:14:16.700 --> 00:14:23.450
don't hide yourself at all or put up a front.

00:14:23.450 --> 00:14:29.910
N-not really... I already don't hide anything

00:14:23.450 --> 00:14:29.910
or put up a front, and I'm used to this so...

00:14:30.370 --> 00:14:33.080
I know! Show me the anime you like.

00:14:33.250 --> 00:14:34.080
Huh?!

00:14:34.080 --> 00:14:38.290
It's always with you, right? That girl that rides the broom.

00:14:40.250 --> 00:14:42.330
Why are you always doing such bad things?!

00:14:42.330 --> 00:14:46.410
Because I'm very fond of all of your sad faces!

00:14:46.410 --> 00:14:49.160
I'm going to make you cry with all my might!

00:14:49.500 --> 00:14:51.250
I won't let you do that!

00:14:51.410 --> 00:14:53.200
With my magic, I will make the smiles of the world bloom!

00:14:53.200 --> 00:14:56.160
So this girl can use magic, huh?

00:14:53.200 --> 00:14:56.160
With my magic, I will make the smiles of the world bloom!

00:14:56.910 --> 00:14:57.910
That's nice...

00:14:59.410 --> 00:15:00.370
Me too...

00:15:00.580 --> 00:15:03.580
In junior high, I thought that while watching this.

00:15:03.950 --> 00:15:06.540
Tsutsun, you're gross! You lolicon!

00:15:06.540 --> 00:15:09.290
Still watching anime even though

00:15:06.540 --> 00:15:09.290
you're old enough to know better, huh?

00:15:10.620 --> 00:15:12.790
They've bloomed!

00:15:13.330 --> 00:15:19.660
Thinking about it, I feel like she's always been

00:15:13.330 --> 00:15:19.660
open-minded towards me from the beginning.

00:15:35.580 --> 00:15:38.910
Oh, I just wanted to touch your hair.

00:15:39.450 --> 00:15:44.830
I didn't know this sensation of another person until now.

00:15:45.450 --> 00:15:48.950
You've felt it. You've felt a kiss many times.

00:15:49.120 --> 00:15:51.500
Y-you're that abrupt?! I don't really remember!

00:15:51.620 --> 00:15:52.620
Is that so?

00:15:59.700 --> 00:16:01.120
Move away a bit.

00:16:01.790 --> 00:16:02.620
No.

00:16:14.700 --> 00:16:16.910
I-I-I interrupted something, didn't I?!

00:16:18.580 --> 00:16:20.250
Why did you bring a whole cake?!

00:16:21.870 --> 00:16:23.370
Birthday?!

00:16:23.700 --> 00:16:27.000
Her b-b-b-b-b-b...

00:16:27.410 --> 00:16:29.700
I wonder what you should do too...

00:16:29.950 --> 00:16:31.040
Right?

00:16:31.290 --> 00:16:33.040
But look! They say this a lot:

00:16:33.040 --> 00:16:35.080
"It's the thought that counts!"

00:16:35.290 --> 00:16:37.540
Tsutsui, you're good at drawing, right?

00:16:37.660 --> 00:16:40.450
The pictures I draw only make people feel gross!

00:16:41.370 --> 00:16:43.870
Oh, I can make clay figures!

00:16:47.950 --> 00:16:49.370
I'll say this in advance, but...

00:16:49.580 --> 00:16:53.620
this can't be made on short notice

00:16:49.580 --> 00:16:53.620
with just a normal amount of concentration.

00:16:53.910 --> 00:16:54.910
That's okay.

00:16:55.080 --> 00:16:57.500
I'll show you the power of concentration

00:16:55.080 --> 00:16:57.500
forged through gaming.

00:16:58.580 --> 00:17:00.580
Okay. Let's start!

00:17:05.700 --> 00:17:07.830
Tsutsun, did you lose weight or something?

00:17:07.830 --> 00:17:11.040
Oh... Lately... I've been staying up and gaming all night...

00:17:11.370 --> 00:17:14.290
If you don't take it easy, it's bad for your body!

00:17:17.370 --> 00:17:18.410
Is it done?

00:17:18.750 --> 00:17:19.870
It's done!

00:17:20.120 --> 00:17:22.000
We did it in time...

00:17:22.120 --> 00:17:24.950
Nice work, Tsutsui! I'll wrap it up!

00:17:25.330 --> 00:17:26.950
Thanks, Ito.

00:17:28.750 --> 00:17:29.620
Hikari!

00:17:29.750 --> 00:17:30.450
Huh?

00:17:30.830 --> 00:17:32.580
I got these, so use them!

00:17:33.500 --> 00:17:35.750
What're they for, an amusement park?

00:17:35.750 --> 00:17:36.580
Right.

00:17:36.910 --> 00:17:38.660
And you got them from who, now?

00:17:38.660 --> 00:17:39.160
Huh?!

00:17:39.580 --> 00:17:41.580
Ma, don't tell me you paid for these yourself...

00:17:41.790 --> 00:17:44.790
It's fine! That doesn't matter!

00:17:46.790 --> 00:17:50.410
Please, don't get more eager than I am. It's awkward.

00:17:54.790 --> 00:17:55.910
An amusement park?

00:17:57.700 --> 00:18:00.450
Let's go! Not after school, but let's go right now!

00:18:00.450 --> 00:18:03.250
Huh? Now? Are you being serious? My credits...

00:18:03.620 --> 00:18:04.660
Tsutsun!

00:18:04.660 --> 00:18:08.540
There are a lot of things in life

00:18:04.660 --> 00:18:08.540
that are more important than credits, you know.

00:18:08.950 --> 00:18:12.120
You're... unusually energetic today, huh?

00:18:16.870 --> 00:18:18.290
Whoa...

00:18:20.700 --> 00:18:22.450
Something wrong, Tsutsun?

00:18:22.830 --> 00:18:27.540
No...Thinking about it, I haven't been

00:18:22.830 --> 00:18:27.540
to an amusement park since elementary school...

00:18:27.750 --> 00:18:31.330
My eyes aren't use to so much shine...

00:18:31.830 --> 00:18:35.450
That's right... this is what

00:18:31.830 --> 00:18:35.450
an amusement park is like, right...?

00:18:36.830 --> 00:18:38.410
Tsutsun, you're weird!

00:18:58.660 --> 00:19:01.290
Let's ride that one next, Tsutsun!

00:19:04.910 --> 00:19:07.120
Shining salmon below!

00:19:09.950 --> 00:19:11.000
What is this...?

00:19:11.410 --> 00:19:13.410
Like I'm floating... floating...

00:19:14.950 --> 00:19:16.370
Tsutsun.

00:19:16.620 --> 00:19:17.410
Here.

00:19:19.160 --> 00:19:20.370
How do you feel?

00:19:22.080 --> 00:19:23.450
I'm already okay.

00:19:23.450 --> 00:19:25.160
It's fine, take your time.

00:19:25.370 --> 00:19:28.120
No... I'm wasting time.

00:19:31.700 --> 00:19:33.040
Then let's ride that one!

00:19:33.200 --> 00:19:34.700
If you go to an amusement park it's the standard-

00:19:34.700 --> 00:19:36.000
Roller coaster, huh?

00:19:36.700 --> 00:19:40.370
Tsutsun, are you thinking

00:19:36.700 --> 00:19:40.370
I'm a demon or something like that?

00:19:45.410 --> 00:19:46.790
Sorry about that.

00:19:47.000 --> 00:19:50.000
We made time to come here

00:19:47.000 --> 00:19:50.000
and I can't ride anything but this...

00:19:50.370 --> 00:19:53.000
What? This is a lot of fun!

00:19:59.410 --> 00:20:00.620
Your birthday.

00:20:00.870 --> 00:20:01.700
Huh?

00:20:04.040 --> 00:20:05.410
You knew?

00:20:07.660 --> 00:20:08.950
Can I open it?!

00:20:09.160 --> 00:20:11.950
Just so you know, it's not something I bought,

00:20:09.160 --> 00:20:11.950
so it's no big deal...

00:20:13.200 --> 00:20:14.830
Um, it's really...

00:20:21.120 --> 00:20:22.700
Is this me?

00:20:23.700 --> 00:20:26.250
You made this? Amazing!

00:20:28.500 --> 00:20:30.620
I'm a sorceress now!

00:20:31.700 --> 00:20:35.120
Thank you. I'm really happy.

00:20:35.500 --> 00:20:38.290
I will always absolutely cherish this.

00:20:39.870 --> 00:20:45.450
At any rate, it sure is cute.

00:20:39.870 --> 00:20:45.450
Is this how cute I appear to you, Tsutsun?

00:20:45.910 --> 00:20:46.790
Yeah.

00:20:47.370 --> 00:20:49.620
You're also using magic.

00:20:50.200 --> 00:20:53.250
When I'm with you, amazing things constantly happen.

00:20:55.120 --> 00:20:59.290
I've definitely always had

00:20:55.120 --> 00:20:59.290
eternal bad luck in a place like this.

00:20:59.910 --> 00:21:01.500
But, you...

00:21:10.410 --> 00:21:11.950
Half a year...

00:21:12.620 --> 00:21:13.750
I hate that.

00:21:15.040 --> 00:21:16.790
Her going away...

00:21:18.200 --> 00:21:19.410
I hate that.
